#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami menyarankan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"You can use options to customize the Executor primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Kamu bisa menggunakan opsi untuk menyesuaikan primitif Executor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can see the available options and update option values during or after "
"primitive initialization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa melihat opsi yang tersedia dan memperbarui nilai opsi selama atau "
"setelah inisialisasi primitif.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `update()` method to apply changes to the `options` attribute.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan metode `update()` untuk menerapkan perubahan pada atribut "
"`options`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The `options` attribute is the `dataclass` Python type.  You can use the built-in `asdict` method to convert it to a dictionary.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Atribut `options` adalah tipe Python `dataclass`. Kamu bisa menggunakan metode bawaan `asdict` untuk mengubahnya menjadi dictionary.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set Executor options {#set-executor-options}"
msgstr "Atur opsi Executor {#set-executor-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an option is specified both during and after primitive initialization, "
"the value set after initializing the primitive is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika suatu opsi ditentukan baik saat maupun setelah inisialisasi primitif, "
"nilai yang ditetapkan setelah menginisialisasi primitif yang digunakan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Primitive initialization {#primitive-initialization}"
msgstr "Inisialisasi primitif {#primitive-initialization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can pass in an instance of the options class or a dictionary when "
"initializing Executor, which then makes a copy of those options. Thus, "
"changing the original dictionary or options instance doesn't affect the "
"options owned by the primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa meneruskan instansi kelas opsi atau dictionary saat "
"menginisialisasi Executor, yang kemudian membuat salinan opsi tersebut. "
"Jadi, mengubah dictionary atau instansi opsi asli tidak mempengaruhi opsi "
"yang dimiliki primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Options class {#options-class}"
msgstr "Kelas opsi {#options-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When creating an instance of the `Executor` class, you can pass in an "
"instance of the options class. Those options are then applied when you use "
"`run()` to perform the calculation.  Specify the options in this format:  "
"`options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: "
"`options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat membuat instansi kelas `Executor`, kamu bisa meneruskan instansi kelas "
"opsi. Opsi tersebut kemudian diterapkan saat kamu menggunakan `run()` untuk "
"melakukan perhitungan. Tentukan opsi dalam format ini: `options.option.sub-"
"option.sub-sub-option = choice`. Misalnya: `options.environment.log_level = "
"INFO`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Contoh:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Dictionary {#dictionary}"
msgstr "Dictionary {#dictionary}"

