#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Feature compatibility {#feature-compatibility}"
msgstr "Kompatibilitas fitur {#feature-compatibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the "
"appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the "
"selected feature:\n"
msgstr ""
"Fitur-fitur runtime tertentu tidak bisa digunakan bersama dalam satu job. "
"Klik tab yang sesuai untuk melihat daftar fitur yang tidak kompatibel dengan"
" fitur yang dipilih:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Dynamic\" label=\"Dynamic circuits\">\n"
"  Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Dynamic\" label=\"Dynamic circuits\">\n"
"  Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling is incompatible with the [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction.\n"
"  - Compatible with fractional gates when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 or later.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Catatan lain:\n"
"  - Gate twirling bisa diterapkan pada dynamic circuit, tapi hanya pada gate yang tidak ada di dalam blok kondisional.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling hanya bisa diterapkan pada pengukuran terminal.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling tidak kompatibel dengan instruksi [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store).\n"
"  - Kompatibel dengan fractional gates saat menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 atau lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"DD\" label=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"  Incompatible with dynamic circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"DD\" label=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"  Tidak kompatibel dengan dynamic circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "  </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"Fractional\" label=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"  Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"Fractional\" label=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"  Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Compatible with dynamic circuits when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 "
"or later.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kompatibel dengan dynamic circuit saat menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` "
"v0.42.0 atau lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"ZNE\" label=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"ZNE\" label=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuit\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Might not work when using custom gates.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Twirling\" label=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"  Incompatible with fractional gates or with stretches.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Mungkin tidak berfungsi saat menggunakan custom gate.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Twirling\" label=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"  Tidak kompatibel dengan fractional gates atau stretch.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks. Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Catatan lain:\n"
"  - Gate twirling bisa diterapkan pada dynamic circuit, tapi hanya pada gate yang tidak ada di dalam blok kondisional. Measurement twirling hanya bisa diterapkan pada pengukuran terminal.\n"
"  - Tidak berfungsi dengan entangler non-Clifford.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEA\" label=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEA\" label=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuit\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEC\" label=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEC\" label=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuit\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</Tabs>\n"
msgstr "</Tabs>\n"

